<item rdf:about="https://tech.slashdot.org/story/26/09/26/0042239/meta-made-43m-misleading-statements-new-mexico-jury-finds-including-on-its-cambridge-analytica-response?utm_source=rss1.0mainlinkanon&amp;utm_medium=feed">
<title>Meta Made 43M Misleading Statements, New Mexico Jury Finds, Including on Its Cambridge Analytica Response</title>
<link>https://tech.slashdot.org/story/26/09/26/0042239/meta-made-43m-misleading-statements-new-mexico-jury-finds-including-on-its-cambridge-analytica-response?utm_source=rss1.0mainlinkanon&amp;utm_medium=feed</link>
<description>A New Mexico jury on Friday "found Facebook liable for deceiving users" about its privacy protections, reports the Associated Press. 

